The 68000 images a standalone build contains.

The Maven build writes the twenty-two here, as it writes them to build/68k
and into the classes the jar is made of, so a Go executable built after it
needs neither this repository nor an assembler beside it.

A tree built without them does not contain one, and Read then gives nil
back: a caller resolves an image as it otherwise would, out of build/68k
beside the templates DTX_68K names.

The .bin files are build output and are not committed.
